One of five kinds of gemstones that can be acquired from having the [[Box of Riches]].

There are five rarities of Rubies, Chipped/Flawed/Regular/Flawless/Perfect, corresponding to the five rarities of items in the game. Each rarity has better stats than the previous one. Higher rarities can be found in the shop if the player has a Box of Riches, or by combining identical ones in the inventory.

The gemstones have varying effects depending on where they are placed.

When socketed in a [[Weapon]], the [[Emerald]] has a chance to inflict {{icon/poison}} on hit, with both the likelihood and quantity increased by the rarity. When socketed in [[Armor]] or other items, the [[Emerald]] gives a chance to resist {{icon/poison}}, which can be good in certain matchups. When loose in the backpack, the [[Emerald]] gives some {{icon/regeneration}} once after a short period of time, with the amount increased by the rarity. Each of these can be useful, but they can be especially useful socketed in the weapons of a [[Poison]] build, or in the backpack of a character with ways to spend {{icon/regeneration}}.

